\end{align*}

\end_inset

Let 
\begin_inset Formula $\bar{\Gb}_{t}:=\frac{1}{2}\sum_{s=1}^{t}\sum_{k=1}^{K}\rho_{s}p_{s}(k)x_{k,s}x_{k,s}^{\top}+\lambda_{t}\Ib_{d}.$
